#HELPS
1 DREN PLANTATION~
Dren Plantation is a large netch farm spread across the fertile Ascadian Isles
where guarded fields, slave shacks and docks support its wealthy noble master.
Dunmer and Nord guards patrol among Khajiit and Argonian workers in the fields
as hidden moon sugar crates show a thriving smuggling trade.~
